KINDS
[gate is a door].

DEFINE
[a gate named north gate
a gate named south gate
a device named brass bell].

START
[north gate has "North  Gate!" title
south gate has "South Gate." title].

WHEN
[player sounds brass bell
<then> (change title of every gate to "OPEN — RubyVM!"].

IF
[north gate has "OPEN — RubyVM!" title
<then> (damage player].
